                <note rend="inline" type="source">511.4A6/375: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-07-03T15:00:00-04:00">July 3, 1931—3
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>15. Your telegram 34, July 2, 10 a.m. Matter receiving consideration. Meanwhile
                    Department desires Delegation’s comment and recommendations.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
